.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trace 1  "trace " 
.SH NAME
trace \- Trace a knowledge element back to its origin
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrace\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIELEMENT_ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Trace a knowledge element back to its origin
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact arrow\-joined path rendering
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIELEMENT_ID\fR>
Target element ID (UUID or prefix) to trace
